    "lesson-id": "y9_mea_11",
    "lesson-focus": "Model direct-proportion situations — pro rata pay rates, currency exchange, multiple quotes for a job, Hooke's law from physics; investigate situations where proportion is not maintained (image editing/distortion); building and construction standards for staircases and escalators.",
    "ac9-descriptor": "AC9M9M05",
    "ac9-descriptor-text": "use mathematical modelling to solve practical problems involving direct proportion, rates, ratio and scale, including financial contexts; formulate the problems and interpret solutions in terms of the situation; evaluate the model and report methods and findings",
    "ac9-elaborations": "1,2,3",
    "sa-year": "9",
