      {
        "q": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 260 110\" width=\"260\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Photo 1200 by 800 pixels resized to a width of 900 pixels with unknown height\" style=\"display:block;margin:6px 0\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"10\" width=\"120\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#dde8ea\" stroke=\"#1F4D54\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"70\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#1F4D54\">1200 × 800</text><rect x=\"160\" y=\"30\" width=\"90\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#f3f7f8\" stroke=\"#BE5837\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 3\"/><text x=\"205\" y=\"64\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#BE5837\">?</text><text x=\"205\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#BE5837\">900 × ?</text></svg>A 1200 × 800 pixel photo is resized to a width of <strong>900 pixels</strong> without distortion. What is the new height in pixels?",
